 defaults at /usr/share/pnetlab-docker/daemon.defaults.json: admin edits are
 preserved, hosts (unix-only) + live-restore are force-set, and dockerd is
 restarted only when those forced keys actually changed. Address pools default
 to 10.177.0.0/16 size 24 (256 networks).
